          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Wallets",
            "content": "<p>Use recommended amount of cards in each product:</p><ul><li>Phone case: 2-4 cards/cash</li><li>Elastic: 2-10 cards/cash</li><li>Vertical: 2-8 cards/cash</li><li>Bifold: 4-10 cards/cash</li><li>Magnetic: 8-10 cards/cash</li><li>Pull cards/cash up and not out.</li></ul><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong>HOW TO CLEAN</strong></p><ul><li>Elastic products are washable, remove metal key rings to prevent rust.</li><li>The logo is designed to withstand machine washing, but there is always the small possibility that they can detach just from everyday wear and tear!</li><li>Leather and magnetic products are not machine-washable, but any elastic on our bifolds, verticals, phone cases, or magnetic wallets can be spot-treated.</li></ul>",
