          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Lanyards/Keychains",
            "content": "<p>Lanyards and keychains are made to hold the essentials, but they are not built to hold everything. When the clasps are weighed down with multiple items, there is an increased chance that something will fall off.</p><p>We have found that the lanyards function best with just a few keys, a Thread wallet, and Thread lip balm holder!</p><p>For keychains, your keys and any other items are meant to be attached to the keyring end of the keychain, and the clip can be attached to bags and belt loops.</p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong>HOW TO CLEAN</strong></p><ul><li>Hand wash and spot clean, being careful to avoid getting the leather wet.</li></ul>",
