            "content": "<p></p><p><strong>HOW TO CLEAN</strong></p><ul><li>Tote Bag: Do not machine wash, do not bleach, do not tumble dry, do not iron. Hand wash and dry flat.</li><li>Crossbody bags, fanny packs, & backpacks: Machine wash; we recommend using a delicate setting in cold water, dry flat.</li><li>Clear Crossbody Bag & Fanny Pack: Hand wash only, wipe clean.</li><li>Honey Crossbody Bag: Hand wash only.</li><li>﻿Off-white Crossbody Bag & Fanny Pack: Hand wash only.</li></ul>",
